  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Goal**\n\nI\'m now focused on clarifying the user\'s ultimate goal: a functional web application based on the given inspiration and mockups. I need to fully understand the project\'s scope, objectives, and any implicit requirements. I\'m dissecting the prompt and the provided assets to create a strong foundation.\n\n\n**Defining the Requirements**\n\nI\'ve got a much clearer picture! Cars on Caledon is a pre-owned vehicle dealership in South Africa. The user wants a beautiful, production-ready React SPA with an interactive search, financing calculator, and animations. The mockups are my style guide. I\'m focusing on client-side functionality unless server-side logic becomes necessary, but for now, it\'s just client-side. The app needs high-quality organization and customizable filters for the pre-owned inventory with a dynamic vehicle details modal.\n\n\n**Evaluating Skill Set**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the available skills. Given the explicit directive to avoid unnecessary additions, I\'m carefully evaluating if `image-generation` or `gemini-api` are truly essential or potentially unwanted features. The user\'s emphasis on a focused, streamlined application is guiding this assessment. The goals are simple: beautiful imagery, and beautiful presentation, not \"unsolicited features\". I am focused on the image options, and also the chatbot options, and the question of how to integrate them.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will examine the `package.json` file to confirm its contents and verify our development environment."
    thinking_duration {
