    summary: "The official Facebook logo primarily uses the color blue with a white \"f\"[1]. The hex code for Facebook\'s primary blue is #1877F2[2][3][4], though sometimes it is also listed as #1778F2[5]. The white color, used for the \"f\" and as a background, has the hex code #FFFFFF[2][6].\n\nOther colors associated with Facebook\'s branding and interface include Athens Gray (#F0F2F5)[2], and sometimes black and other shades of grey are also mentioned as official brand colors[7].\n\n\"Cars on Caledon\" is a car dealership located in Kariega (Uitenhage Central)[8][9][10][11][12]. While they likely have a Facebook page, the specific colors of their dealership\'s logo are not provided in the search results.\n\nSources:\n[1] [meta.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF9A44YJaOuja4GDcrVSbmTJAwork1DlgKQlljvtM1dr-oFokW6Yo2ROYbo9NLTbNNkpm0oH2m95BYrRrtD0edSMOyzL5tyKBU_9vkCEpSIyQ_mdwM9o_nAY99zs5TMhxQvdKB-V7WXcFrq6fhtlQ==)\n[2] [mobbin.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEEZ3sBkQ81HrN1MmUksWYk2l6tVIY27ES1sR8900lj9Q_GvRMTfe-mAidhDkaVapsEOPipNtTUwdE09GFbFB6cqOUPS9wnD257c0GIUibL1sHrquyPsWcsiLx0XRcwiQAtg24=)\n[3] [color-name.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHCLDoASnmsYRYnlgrGtQKtrqsm3vcU4BmpIpCQ8J-J0RwKKqQwyhxRQKS83cZj0ZCOMeYwaY2sSKIv3VorDkBGsKJUcFCvF11rdqSWWU-1EKmIs7E3d-XzqsFlvMseNNTH7hUTaqW72bA=)\n[4] [brandcolorcode.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQED-V20GgFC59Y8Iz4MZmVlIxc5W8gHlsTkVXYqd1ZPBOd3pWOc7dReKUHc2eb8KBkM-CvjTpWhcA_1RfCezu3RWzv32xbozzabkcEK511xOJxRHJBWy70vagAPjxOgqHupcg==)\n[5] [schemecolor.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQErTom38ni5AR6A2YABSWeDRz_U7HeXhOziSSnZM4imjEtzlGMyi6rMVF3TxYcM27lk7NbdR1CHeJZ3h1_nW9i38VhaGo4bq8Dabp5huVHUdBKY4YWwiADVkMTYRlDliiH12IfZHK5VCuVCExnqZFLK0yxSwNcPFw==)\n[6] [brandgradients.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirec