    summary: "A search for \"Cars on Caledon\" in Kariega (formerly Uitenhage), South Africa, reveals information about an automotive business. \"Cars On Caledon\" is listed as a new car dealer located at 257 Caledon St, Uitenhage, Kariega, 6229, South Africa.[1][2] The business is also categorized under general automotive businesses in Uitenhage.[3]\n\nThere are indications that \"Cars On Caledon\" may be closed, with some listings stating \"May be closed\".[2][3] In November 2022, a co-owner of \"Cars on Caledon\" in Kariega, Lance van Aardt, was mentioned as the Uitenhage Tens manager for a local rugby team, and the business was a sponsor for the team.[4] The search results did not yield a direct link to a Facebook page with the specific URL `facebook.com/carsoncaledon/`.\n\nSources:\n[1] [cybo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF2L69YoNK5tKGsn_PuaHbGSx6HeBZN7_rCfqSML36L-7l2zQ1kgJx7pspQF5vIDVAgm1oEzMj1luDAnmmgjiogYGa0TEsGbueIAF8c4zvRkwxee9eYgPsW1kb0C0LvOqEH4RI1MJOQMlaQPgEkSNLKXwcoXW4bHasp9t3pr3arXTszP76RH4FRkRc5I-AVQdM=)\n[2] [cybo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGE7w7L6ru5-gjQ84RV4C6KnujEK2d9svlxW6k-7kGV6XsgyzHjEIN1lO6T7LsofZ-4cJwXD9nt7dFPdPKW6iEtF8vhVP2uHGoogL6lyv7SmvCxUUAlqgkBJ4GSqso2d2bMrT9jfGjf_3kA8GE=)\n[3] [cybo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFgdwGRC13TxgS7pUfjVtf5fbm11BQc2LaRKq3GBMG0DbSvc2FVoz1fCGvk56fkOlDBl-w98Yz4RUOrdidB4A3coVhslZHuhU8t5KX3aGqxaLo-Lz6aXL9sWKIvgaRsHV9qghQOnG4X)\n[4] [novanews.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHGuxnXkDKpsFU3d0RW6QkuYfkwa9H80z2UIjlWkZ1CfWejTCGY0wFG6GhgsTCCCwCytRiLidToOvdKcIUhkgBVm0xbOCDf7zAm5N6qRvZAdUsyenBbg8v7mGvV-kuHJGA3AGtXt6zx53CNfUllsBu4SuLXUu1WTFf55BG9vVEiKNszDH9vUspRkQ==)"
