    summary: "A search for \"carsoncaledon\" or \"cars on caledon\" primarily yields results related to the automotive industry and events in Caledon, a town in Ontario, Canada.\n\nKey findings include:\n*   **Used Car Sales:** Numerous listings and dealerships for used cars are available in Caledon, ON[1][2]. Websites like CarGurus.ca feature popular searches for various types of used vehicles in the area, including sedans, SUVs, hatchbacks, and trucks[1].\n*   **Car Dealerships and Services:** Caledon is home to dealerships such as Caledon Chrysler, which sells new and pre-owned Ram, Dodge, Chrysler, and Jeep vehicles[3]. Caledon Motors is another dealership specializing in quality used cars[4]. These dealerships offer new and used vehicle sales, financing options, and automotive services[3][4].\n*   **Traffic Incidents:** There was a serious multi-vehicle crash on Highway 10 in Caledon on June 29, 2026, involving multiple cars and a tractor-trailer[5].\n\nSources:\n[1] [cargurus.ca](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHM1hZUPcLuuG6lwKyEicoJknozXt6SFt8Y_D5f4sJsvVWAA6VuQlSufwvggVO8gUHXt7AdhpA5VsqJ4VaO9I-MT4BAwp_SGD-fronbvEvjlHv9XNtt1flOOwdLWNPiKAqGrq75gCZMbwG9SIjnLCok-DSr-g==)\n[2] [caledonmitsubishi.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHIx7wx_kM6-VOisM9PC-ILjAT4uX5xQcnL9CDIubJnHUM5Avr69ieFGWO7rvox6K_e39T926fVAgsACMqb40xHO4AvN4Sengz_shb1ha0VYYzXV358AsRtet67quPOMle382iHO_peYDgRvHs=)\n[3] [caledonchrysler.ca](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEuXpsREKS5eBml4MUA_zMdB2lNbYZgFhP0eQPq3ELE4OgQDQG2wHqzydsxHoDONdFHNs4w1OXJxPhFFwqNl5pPVoVie8C_iHA7cHX-DKyc-ecNzBiy)\n[4] [caledonmotors.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEdgev4VuqS9PbuZrPbVwBqEUFgvySR3FYm99MQlIeeCKXz3x82gHTyJKTYu_41FZsSuZ5GkD73LggQ0mlvnZgHR_jtvjOrrP1fHTSw2Pc_anBda-ABoA==)\n[5] [cp24.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHl0IqVrABBn4