      title: "heyautoshops.co.za"
    }
    summary: "\"Cars On Caledon\" appears to be a car dealership located in Uitenhage, South Africa, specializing in pre-owned vehicles[1]. Although a direct Facebook page or group for \"Cars On Caledon\" was not found in the search results, the dealership is listed on automotive platforms like AutoTrader and Destinali[1][2]. It is also identified as a car service provider in local listings in Uitenhage[3][4].\n\nCars On Caledon is located at 257 Caledon Street in Uitenhage Central[1][3]. They offer a range of affordable and reliable pre-owned vehicles and emphasize honest deals with no hidden stories or pressure[1]. The dealership has a rating of 3.3 stars based on 5 reviews on AutoTrader[1].\n\nSources:\n[1] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEwQrFbzQM2dQHbryRQv-zYGtvVj50x-D0CxxsS7zIhciImVUu0s-OqBRu8IqqPof2S55nNrjvYNIRHoHrRfJ5LQQlioufJ05IA5kseX3-o3SYgXlGWI9X8ddnbSoyByfWDuK84smudAwwsVYntO8rCZbu5bw==)\n[2] [destinali.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE6uSyECq0FusobKRsuUTprkqSqz1BYcCACacCZlGhNVn2SaQORvhlMkmBiLf-eYj9lagZ-SBiN_1lmwceYHs-PalMDpDXwgVTscuxUsJQj3g44xEo_Se7mgMW0N4h65IPP_LNPFzOQcPMolbcSSEqfzp7Y8sJH1QqZhNtZDJP_)\n[3] [heyautoshops.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHW7J8AgpFMVp_ajE3z7aIGxA3KN5VHqNs3GDzdm6Txn5Ra8dQ83jDk57sjQidahtdLWn714KJudGtFuoCTPmo7PrKCR8KRiXHroC4-abX4lv3oohC4TMl63KkJiLf6xfomnn9PT77dCWunfw==)\n[4] [heyautoshops.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFUufoJZc_Bpss1MmKs97rkaYr8nZxDkKdYu9NM8EVoZR-AnxYGamVLEY3UHAKq4qe15R6fZn3dYHTPqymVP6WYiq0vOamTWZF6kx4gk_I6OqAPD_nYuEqdsTm3nHa0uXhuuJpzJZfqzSf2)"
