    summary: "\"Cars on Caledon\" appears to be a car dealership located in Uitenhage Central, Kariega, South Africa. It has a rating of 3.3 out of 5 stars based on 5 reviews[1][2][3][4]. The dealership\'s operating hours are Monday to Friday from 8:00 to 17:00, and it is closed on Saturdays, Sundays, and public holidays[1].\n\nWhile several businesses are located on Caledon Street in Kariega, including Hyundai Kariega at 249 Caledon Street[5], KFC at 23 Caledon Street[6][7], Khalifa brother\'s at 198 Caledon Street[8], and Jet Store at 105 Caledon Street[9], specific details regarding the logo colors or banners for \"Cars on Caledon\" were not found in the search results.\n\nSources:\n[1] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF8DuLu6La3e99UAPWM7kLIxZMvFsV8OGrARIWagZ_rRRpZq5EEsgyC-lZ9I-K5TIhktpOqfIFqyCV86U-q7TVf0lkZTyP44_D4K8sRNcCaXSeX6YOuyAqZ2xJ-bwk7BM3tLo0OqOvuuIWaEuTB0D_A4D9Ex49urDT-Yo01f_tdLav1SgY=)\n[2] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGJ5X-WhmdX9Fm5cypeloPFCbkVxjf3j_XZcccMNVn8w0-3RfZ0NLbmUxqUmOsVL6nHoIYtSP8971xv3Nyitu1Njmj_8JBxvSmfX52xawUKjQ8nRlHSXSf3fglqLoRBGT8F744DaA_n2tHQun0KlO-WxRi5nW-et3JtYzVHYMwgh1ffnwyen2DgtcpZ7UwDF6uPh-Gt0RYzXtSo2X_0ulE=)\n[3] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEogYXAGBwRqGqy9mFp_kf_g8WzQhL98oP3zNcpBOA2uuCvF3FO4C30wkG0vx7p066jHyq8SJKHmkGyNpkINQcgs9sGN-tA5UdRONCSK-qXFTTKT22OI_B8xKx_fC1cq5rScMRNM4IQssmaWP2G6yqM69zs_T7XGuyzJoy9D4-ljdp8ZZMHspKTZ7U2MtNXbPw=)\n[4] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHPZQYWC4f7iGLwTTEGVsUl5viUJYVOUjuPaSbtzJ1Qt8acZ9vkAjaddkjbb0TXiM_QlC9hcgc7YQLJ_BlnLXLje5e9XuyjVv4X0f1sgZdedXBGaavGSptPP5e0ll0fmhaNJpZkaOb9Zprk2T2c_50AGt3SQkSZZ8FYoS_nK4mwGD74ighP3Ft-NjoR)\n[5] [kelston.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHKZGKvQlTL911_49yjTUjj4m7el1CjdCR-xNtaE1mbMrUmtsSe4betX7s0WnXcfw