    summary: "\"Cars on Caledon\" appears to refer to a car dealership located in Kariega, South Africa (formerly Uitenhage). Several automotive businesses are situated on Caledon Street in Kariega.\n\nSpecifically, \"Cars On Caledon\" is a dealership listed on AutoTrader, which offers both new and used cars[1]. While the search results don\'t explicitly list cars by the requested colors (blue, yellow, red, green, black, or gold) for \"Cars On Caledon,\" other dealerships on Caledon Street in Kariega might have vehicles in these colors.\n\nOther car dealerships found on Caledon Street in Kariega include:\n*   **Hyundai Kariega:** Located at 249 Caledon Street, they offer a range of new and used Hyundai vehicles[2].\n*   **Koedoes Auto:** A used car dealer located at 41 Caledon, 17 Tern Street, Rosedale, Kariega[3].\n*   **Caledon Motors:** This dealership focuses on quality used cars[4].\n*   **Caledon Toyota:** This dealership offers new and used Toyota vehicles[5][6][7].\n\nTo find cars of specific colors, it would be best to directly inquire with these dealerships in Kariega.\n\nSources:\n[1] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGKobkDou6n5BSM3J6MrZri4jWcTKVMSTZ4YGtIW128oIfnoQgctjEgteqJNPBX5W1b06aD_zgKlz3bJkLXY_VDu4BrYkwZZ-VrSeKhE3CC62O-fadl_FRkkz28j55LfovTcm7ZnuhgR08hKx0Jsx5d2yPE)\n[2] [kelston.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFvwSUMuheh9TWlWkELfDrKMJql4lbTAFRePZmxVpCSuYGPRtzRrj5Lqis-cmYUPaf-1AHaVFKoaITuKYk974HdhPX26XSl79YxXbeWXdMhDQyO4d0HbdghdFpi5L1U2aHTREworLz1sE8x0G50)\n[3] [sayellow.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHI0FNuJEVj2XyhaOzX2ihXAVA50QIFsvsg0dyINDwk-x7sFEci0zrSzSd5Vj3Auf8vefBNnRWGEO_QTC-50JaJifqUvTfX-dnDDENS1lF7ScfOJZ1poZ6gtmBl2rA5DqlEALvxrC9Tw0Pjd__lKKpb4sx-uekJlWsksJvl)\n[4] [caledonmotors.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFHtw3VOMah5ZfrfoRNV2vGhsEd_QgLNwif67iaxBTkmhQjI5kxPF