    summary: "The search on AutoTrader.co.za for \"Caledon\" and either \"Kariega\" or \"Uitenhage\" reveals a dealership called \"Cars On Caledon\" located in Uitenhage Central[1]. This dealership specializes in affordable, reliable pre-owned vehicles and has 17 listings available[1]. The address for \"Cars On Caledon\" is in Uitenhage Central, and they have a rating of 3.3 stars based on 5 reviews[1]. Some examples of their current listings include a 2021 Volkswagen T-Roc 1.4TSI 110kW Design and a 2022 Volkswagen Transporter 2.0TDI 110kW Kombi SWB Trendline[1].\n\nWhile not directly AutoTrader listings, other search results indicate that Caledon Street is a significant location in Kariega (formerly Uitenhage), with various establishments such as Heba Guest Lodge Two Kariega at 166 Caledon Street[2], Uitenhage Stay at 42 Caledon Street[3], and 72 on Caledon, a student housing property[4].\n\nSources:\n[1] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF6eSco1Pm29xotMXazqpaaatd9ArKGjiJDV6blGL0eA0vwo1Hmv8EAXrtpXRR86s4VcHuCnMSNq4hSgC0tykkNyWT9WLYxRs0xiDLuyWaM090lvQrJZZ8kwnNmN4Yjs_cBUT547OQVt_R3GbfjMl1gswpu_A==)\n[2] [za-hotels.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFpZsQp3W_LpjWC3bxtRbmoh8biK8YX4r_pYGb8B1pC2CcG-nA3taGUqyfRHk-UlC9c3KGBbOmWe6hEpv-3qxwFu5suA6MjgMGfRUd82dWmyUVe0V81JK7st1Yfjrs1DHELNy4aCqolDtGdncEpfaY=)\n[3] [waze.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQERY150EKA2Z-zsTJoMIVvAzHPFJD6kQ5MY2XyNQK24DaiYju3PNZv3T7S1HfpnZ-B3JuJu99Ns7e-rBBZHpGVxQvrN7IaPPCZhiSxKIFxzwPN2vpQ8J05mUqSN1MHbmi6LBr_anDCQxngEhac-MGQEWBSVZ1uad5i8cK2bBL1iRQvrmIU4OHJ8_Vephe0eiXnIfE_5tQXcwTddDoXcSVcs3wpswWs=)\n[4] [nsfas.org.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHGNM5u-qhz5vyjUlUHie1HrvIVADZhVbBRC3XPEPRLFsfKxGDDpfKN1pKT0Bm7Da8nfQKtxsH3K4LYZIxvwAkO-bU8a3-LYEZXutkS7-Tr_i89uKg0xmLpZjtmhJr4hCe32aYEaPJ3DolECrMlybwl-kvPK68Xe5qNGmV-b3lDQyMm6OGpxdPS-YNqrz7TFk