    summary: "\"Cars On Caledon\" is a car dealership located in Uitenhage Central, South Africa[1][2][3]. The dealership has several blue cars available for sale.\n\nCurrently, vehicles at \"Cars On Caledon\" include:\n*   A 2023 Volkswagen Tiguan 1.4TSI 110kW Life in \"Night Shade Blue Metallic\"[4].\n*   A 2023 Volkswagen Polo Hatch 1.0TSI 70kW in blue[5].\n\nThe dealership specializes in affordable, reliable pre-owned vehicles[1]. Uitenhage is part of the Nelson Mandela Bay Metropolitan Municipality, which also encompasses Kariega.\n\nSources:\n[1] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGO6yYJWAw2m9Lwz8e07sJuqqaZB8mvIuJqPLuAyjbxJyi5oG-eqdYwUQlhkn-2XEYRT5UoGIdrlf-UZ02C_seeeUJXRKVCxj_vxZrZJbR7dqqjRm6jzXdHoGynue3LqGpT8EuVBT4juqw8_oneGb-tURqkQw==)\n[2] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFVnlNPFP6EugftjTml1BOnCcYW2DvI2tm99rlCl1mw3OBWxVOHC4J8CIRcvcYkZXH8rLJLkazvvWkhzRy7421M4QVml4prXsbhw-5zkydS_xBnnKuuxluOBqzO5K-pHttViaZYZ3DejED50cLbBGDA4fVuwEFrzLVDUXzRhx_4dY6w6Nj0oOx441tSDg8-n-nTMqg=)\n[3] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE1vqnK9aMLRwVHybncXrHHPsO9C-H2GbdeMByP91BxbB6D7R3umPUAT2wA9U-rgMUIWdE8jQVAHiGOtNi5Nuz1nD4s4DM9EjhS7ZhMC0RJ7vIMqqnYxIOLDS69j3uUziqDG2nmbqclp9HYFlBzbLWrDO4dkGKspsD70ai5VzZCXhImNSzQIy1N)\n[4] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG-dq6P1TU5-QquEsucgiRXxhaQTgOLiGwS9b4Khuc2Jdz-GPIjCb0RFSijD0hiAh9c4Cv8HTlYHrl_HaEhJ8H-c-gquKM-RrXjVG0n3Nnx8zChKl9kbqJPDgi5zS0HlZAfOI1BeHuf32wV9iEQ3Lku0nPq40pZFvWG50OWIchiN-tEZodMHg==)\n[5] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF25l0QPUOS5Uzen7-SevfoFEvi8PpFj-7D8YjSUhiZ3c3Ea3Crdp_05Q_Cczm7qN7MWlm-lPaTWNivicbJMfh3KrLh3todTHHjapVLw-fu_szXqVqSEfkrggiL3RQWGbx-1B2Qncc6JHGQtLzf7vvuZ0WUmeP-5hxZuC5Th72wt7TvJVY=)"
