    summary: "\"Cars On Caledon\" refers to a car dealership located in Uitenhage, which has been officially renamed Kariega, South Africa. The dealership is situated on Caledon Street[1][2][3][4][5][6][7][8][9]. They specialize in affordable, reliable pre-owned vehicles, offering fair deals and transparent transactions[1].\n\nCaledon Street in Uitenhage/Kariega is a hub for several other automotive businesses, including:\n*   **Koedoes Auto**: A used car dealer located at 41 Caledon Street, Cannon Hill[10].\n*   **CFAO Mobility Toyota Uitenhage (also known as Algoa Toyota Uitenhage)**: Situated at 140 Caledon Street, this dealership offers new and used Toyota vehicles, along with sales, service, and parts[11][12][13][4][5][14].\n*   **Hyundai Kariega**: Located at 249 Caledon Street, offering a range of Hyundai vehicles, sales, service, and parts[15].\n*   **Kelston Chery Uitenhage**: Also found at 249 Caledon Street, providing Chery vehicles and related services[16].\n*   **Tyremart Uitenhage / Kelston Tyremart Kariega**: Located at 249 Caledon Street, offering tyres, brakes, shocks, and batteries[17][18][19].\n*   **Ledon Car Mart**: Another car dealer on Caledon Street at number 194[8].\n*   **Van Vuuren Motors Uitenhage**: A service provider at 62 Caledon Street[20].\n\nAdditionally, historical legal documents mention a motor vehicle collision that occurred on July 4, 2019, at the intersection of John and Caledon streets in Kariega, Uitenhage[21].\n\nSources:\n[1] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHTAONAyJx5dbtd3W58MqCkq29c_JMV8CCw-LSSR7DQxekgTc420rqySiDDExOYmmtb0SPUTgySFjrFWmTnXp4cJES-y0TrMvZHI85Npvh1_STqTDUnCQB0EuijMSN3GFiszZoK_Osk3sQYReQopjAAJuYZ)\n[2] [cybo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEz6YlAdPX5yJYqQy7fY8kJAD9WehUgBWdywp7-9xbsiYvmLjT3-YiYAsUTE4peO2lTA6Nrw2XPahvw8lW5L6eb8HS0O0paOZz2yw6zo60g55EnPjiMOWDhLrmxMO12x2lHP09crgqWzjYUrWy4g3rB2ThgTCoK0Fc=)\n[3] [cybo.co