    summary: "Several car dealerships are located on Caledon Street in both Kariega (formerly Uitenhage) and Uitenhage, offering vehicles in various colors including blue, green, and red.\n\nIn Uitenhage, \"Cars On Caledon\" is a dealership specializing in pre-owned vehicles[1]. As of recent listings, they have a 2023 Volkswagen Polo Hatch 1.0TSI 70kW available in blue[2]. Another vehicle listed by \"Cars On Caledon\" is a 2005 Volkswagen Citi 1.4i Chico in red[3]. Other automotive businesses on Caledon Street in Uitenhage include Kelston Chery Uitenhage at 249 Caledon Street[4], CFAO Mobility Toyota Uitenhage at 140 Caledon Street[5][6], and Koedoes Auto at 41 Caledon Street[7].\n\nIn Kariega, Hyundai Kariega is located at 249 Caledon Street[8]. They have a 2024 Hyundai Grand i10 1.2 Premium AT MY24 in \"SPARK GREEN\" among their used car offerings[8]. Caledon Motors, a workshop and filling station, is also situated at 295 Caledon Street in Kariega[9]. Kelston Tyremart Kariega is located at 249 Caledon Street, Uitenhage, which might indicate a shared or nearby location with Kelston Chery or Hyundai[10].\n\nSources:\n[1] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEl4vvg_QH2QgjHFWU0EbkKYXqFib6jdizmmKOjVcfYeAN98IBThq3VR8DOMxgwHS5-QzTego8SXzigaUngJzeVK8vlze8zYz3vPKeTjK8iPnTJIhAzgVKIb8hWnhvBfbIZ_hmTCfBuwpYY2KnH96FdQFcD3Q==)\n[2] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGMEDn7ABeGM88FepklCfT7S9skK4iCR3un220eBC7qd5uNmgs93IZgz0YY_4bShVsUMqTny4ekxwmug6AKPLSN0JHyRBLgnMrcGRqksu9r_ZMPlD7taiInPXlaUQqmbS22RPOKoDSOTF64V4dKxMLOdNZ65Oigo451Z0zUGzbeiLP54ok=)\n[3] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHK8FYOi-mzthaD6ek1e9uoXdOCqePwQMlZ1f4r9aK3Kh2hlVHAaTAxrwzB-VfwLDkdg1vEv4imOyf3bWeFdYektcmrW0y54tx6mTnyiO8MEUGPwVyI9lKzqdzuGole-__4n29EE1NlKJJRVjH9dra424m30okkymRwE6MoxY_lWsY=)\n[4] [kelston.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-