    summary: "\"Cars On Caledon\" appears in search results related to businesses in Uitenhage, South Africa. It is identified as a car dealership located at 257 Caledon Street[1][2]. The dealership specializes in affordable, reliable pre-owned vehicles, aiming for quality cars and fair deals without hidden stories or pressure[3].\n\n\"Cars On Caledon\" has a rating of 3.3 stars from 5 reviews on AutoTrader[3]. According to listings, they keep it simple with honest deals and value for customers, whether they are buying their first car or upgrading[3]. They are listed as a car service provider and car dealership in Uitenhage, with operating hours varying depending on the listing[1][2]. For instance, one listing indicates they open at 09:00, while another states they are open until 05:00[1][2].\n\nThe business is also listed on Destinali, an automotive directory, which likely aggregates local business information[4]. Several used vehicles are listed for sale from \"Cars On Caledon\" on AutoTrader, including Volkswagen T-Roc, Volkswagen Transporter, and Ford Ranger models[3][5].\n\nSources:\n[1] [heyautoshops.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH-YncrNrO4VtPE65MULq2WvWRTntJVMQux84siuKY3duCzmxofKaSyBx5zo3z0YnipWUsnVF3tOz4URCVUDlsp37dv7tOj1wfvnlzI_3tadPqRa6ijbt_JjFspEi-UpU9BrtEmTJ_DKyy5Cg==)\n[2] [heyautoshops.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHzdCulPgHjSHFKlyO1-qIjQoMbTbVwCHTYjOaWsTxYgWrK-S3X1d3KWyvjbYA-DmV_Kr7rLHYtzE-kA-o9PwXDu3mzaFJJEU-1n1fKiu3qXWBg9KOUhTKHBReYNg6bKhQw5OMI8qJijuEF)\n[3] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGjYnbRF9t1GOZUlbqRfzcOo05BOM0lYrqPgOSecWsaF2MeBSzCP0iAuX58N4Rm9Vm5blY3-mq6cda7ir_t8Leo8ykCE-IELAqVs3D11wSSi2yhG66yLqutAT_ujrcJC7LYugGcJIzhUNm9H1ju6erA5m7jCQ==)\n[4] [destinali.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFhelu1_R16E_mTBpkx0xqBLDwP9TGRcKpLVr9FMsxr3U2r0hK-g6ec4yh2rutoZFEGc0X1