    summary: "Caledon Street in Uitenhage, also known as Kariega, is home to several car dealerships. These include \"Cars On Caledon\" at 257 Caledon Street, which specializes in affordable, reliable pre-owned vehicles[1][2][3]. Other dealerships on Caledon Street in Uitenhage include CFAO Mobility Toyota Uitenhage (formerly Algoa Toyota Uitenhage) at 140 Caledon Street, offering new and used Toyota vehicles, parts, and service[4][5][6][7][2][8], and Kelston Hyundai Uitenhage at 249 Caledon Street[8][3]. Koedoes Auto, a used car dealer, is located at 41 Caledon Street, Rosedale, Kariega[9].\n\nWhile these dealerships offer a variety of new and pre-owned cars, the specific colors of available vehicles, such as blue, orange, yellow, or green, are not detailed in the search results. Group1 Nissan, located at 36 Church Street (just off Caledon Street) in Uitenhage, also sells quality used vehicles of various makes and models[10]. Kariega is also notable as the location of Volkswagen South Africa\'s manufacturing plant, which produces VW Polo models for export[11].\n\nSources:\n[1] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHJOuQM7YsSS3JDtYBlP3EuelT7e7RW3Y2w1jPX3RZ3YY_G5_nfn8z0BPYtbCu8p0UE6iUObsijIvehywaWRMPA9byuublafizVkwphNFapVc19oVv0h8ZnB1sxgqfK52c5YnTnA6wHF45mUthrz5_Cu3cT)\n[2] [cybo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFHb8rAYEbz9tJPgwR6vj8kTEd7QC_k1Wi_HzWyOUAyBQupewPYbvpW687XO4d67IoTtG4uBSxLJSN5YO8WkmAvjl7agulOX6rxVsjMR-EUj5L2FZutB0ICU9tB77GULSS5Kula_28dUYeWjA==)\n[3] [cybo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEVpjbs-pbTkyIXkZ2QDznofs2g78JwoltLMp-UHEyfzmbiNtEzV-iNQ8Vzm12eAMPY4DaUudBqmqIcRKmvDQ9ZTkDgU3_oVsyxNIhTjPRnkoiZkKoG28IlmPA1LMP-uNFDeIQyT8H8)\n[4] [cars.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFLw3UHGncc70KZBbrELhUcu3DTJ0-j7NXp6_YleZX3UhTZdVyTvuEH3iBRzPdw2ClZDlXGJI-mG30d7FvP-qXi68P1eQBxEB0f1uJkecVQ37FPCkVlgq