    summary: "While a direct logo specifically named \"Cars on Caledon\" was not identified, search results reveal several related logos and entities in the Caledon area that are associated with cars and feature various colors.\n\nCaledon Chrysler and CarHub Caledon Chrysler, both car dealerships, utilize a \"Caledon CarHub Logo\"[1][2]. These dealerships list a wide array of vehicle colors, including blue, yellow, orange, green, grey, red, silver, white, brown, beige, and gold[3][4][5]. Caledonian Travel, a company offering coach holidays, displays a \"feefo logo yellow\" in conjunction with their customer ratings[6]. Additionally, \"Caledonian MacBrayne\" operates ferry services and features a logo related to their brand[7]. The City of Brampton, which borders Caledon, also has an \"Official logo of Brampton\"[8].\n\nSources:\n[1] [caledonchrysler.ca](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH9H1j4fLKFSzqNlTfuwqQEOXfhvaE_vsivKjA6fLtDIRP5Cf23ZvcIcCiUM4Ruemt5dkgJBPdQFwexyCk0y8n0PaPJkby-QQ86MyI2M2r90TSvaDvdnaBseMqt-STZNFkBN2c=)\n[2] [caledonchrysler.ca](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEwhrwpMk_DmfpPElYgxqHzNlNgiV-_BiVnGz7n2Pi9MZEW_tU2gUAlVzCK3fOHZIFRpCTAM5HoRQ4Kq-WrmkmHxh_nnwuhvKdUCEt_gISj8wEqZZKiJzKdNqrMWehmfmgkrZ19c_YA5Q==)\n[3] [caledonchrysler.ca](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHZ4ladjaED-8_WcYz0QNFf95rrW8kGP_XLxoBOZ8AHQWqXGotJ8rFMlTYO8YNYGYKGDvTz8GuPsIOilB4rJra0dcv2c-rg15yPUWuGOgC_v-49oO07p6y3oVObvoLBWfScLt4NMqxNDbJIkCTwW7Z8__S51PGUswZpaw==)\n[4] [caledonchrysler.ca](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEQyMq_BD5LhHBA6YsZC0FPzBJnh-CSW6_p48ybO8z0H4J6RxTucn2967L80B_h6IV1W7S6Ji13-Mu6v87m_cgzibXhrafDWsjo1ZQ5ErjjeKmUvkE1GuASoYAsadRbUallGys71uJPDgtdEBSfPg==)\n[5] [caledonchrysler.ca](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQELOLL6liO1iECHukqRTRig8JUvSp15MOVIH8u2RwhdsSYcCoPGrXNzyoVGbfGPFCxnusqEjt-fXAbVEkY6HRV