    summary: "Searching for \"carsoncaledon\" or \"Cars on Caledon\" on Facebook and Instagram reveals information primarily related to a car dealership in Uitenhage, South Africa.\n\n\"Cars On Caledon\" is a dealership specializing in affordable, reliable pre-owned vehicles. They are located in Uitenhage Central and have an average rating of 3.3 stars based on 5 reviews[1][2][3][4]. The dealership emphasizes \"quality cars, fair deals, no nonsense,\" aiming for honest deals and real value for customers whether they are buying their first car or upgrading[1].\n\nWhile the search results confirm the existence and details of \"Cars On Caledon\" through platforms like AutoTrader and Destinali, specific direct links to their official Facebook or Instagram profiles were not immediately found in the initial search results[1][2][3][4][5].\n\nSources:\n[1] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFquzEZSVEwQ0CLbWGokfr0bjjb1qpAdzuGYQjk1dhsz_fjPqBKJRa6BBhP_X4aTgkGSHewPaon6NLjIVLcJulVl42EkQ-2PDuoA9chzHHGt4DXmvfHE0uChekR70FsgImTlWbBWqUVmmDqGMJw8wpKyy4E)\n[2] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEXFroZMMljBBWfEfuYESokkSumuRbfLzMmtGGtUCBIK3-l1puP6_3cm496a4E3XJ4LKkBPsP8WyUqFdcaccGie9ny2IqvvT-V4zpX5waUDC2d_ADN6IeYkyAJlxx4wGDs4M065oNFn72FoFOzchqD_rfs0CkrNtxwGiIc=)\n[3] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHuyb_oYF7nCgHusgP9lLtgGz2HJ99YdFAQ6tWWoyRdsI4Vxt2HgGlbnzLABR-11HfGNXR5Nmmu5-taJyKIs5LeAT0BGWuwAXG2ogmXMMip7DSw_5lk685wb9SORdhqQovz4Lea0MSDT_TAfRxN17yYN0uaLYGl9po9on7cEaLsT8pSelPtrw==)\n[4] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFbRiRUfQRGNGcZNOQ8nEmI0-eKYNjk74HpWt5E3nfEiqPjd8hLLG_h49PNqMXvdvIngfblfI0JPrDUEzd5zIW5Ck4sM4mvwhcWKlptFKvOG5p5P73QjW3Qc4RUfKL1qInzQoRbGSwrzsXIXemextk47qE_93sJ61IZEEQg_By5S7hTO2s=)\n[5] [destinali.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/