    summary: "\"Cars on Caledon\" is a car dealership located at 257 Caledon Street in Uitenhage, which is also known as Kariega, South Africa.[1][2][3][4] The dealership specializes in affordable, reliable pre-owned vehicles.[2]\n\nRegarding the specified colors, listings from Cars On Caledon have shown:\n*   A 2023 Volkswagen Polo Hatch 1.0TSI 70kW in **blue** was available for sale.[5]\n*   A 2005 Volkswagen Citi 1.4i Chico in **red** was also listed.[6]\n\nWhile specific listings for cars in orange, yellow, green, black, or gold were not immediately found in the search results, as a dealership selling pre-owned vehicles, their inventory would likely include a variety of colors over time.\n\nSources:\n[1] [cybo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHwEKXMemahfXHFLAtqFmthtIfl8bsWYocy2OyjPe7c4FSMV2pdRCpptqIyETEBT6yypL8hpG3lBlv3RbzPNsKsOBCaUn3yIP_iL5QckSL4mWL78MuPr3Q2TGGHbXiMBdxisG7Q1vsbbUxigEjD)\n[2] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH3pWT1OedQS6xkLGA2MnKsLC81At9LRLvAGmByivPI-Fa5NreKEKYXn9fHcVjbv86H_duaG-Y_XFDsBewtk_TqLqrALL9p_KA1FX2nAGFbpqpZL2hYJOy7ugrHnRBUuZdJZ8zNth0qNzVmBBXl9S0sQgrMWg==)\n[3] [cybo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEXC4re8y725ekpfq8kcjFS1z5VytYRaBZRK9_O0hJFP9zptCj1unr7xD86bEvXCQrPVcZMazKNDREWyoiZYhnNXjWgp1nYaDgJwfoQsw0_DahWLPV4M99b5scTHW4fLLWkWalwxjIyslyL594ECHq2xlQHEHGc15Ce)\n[4] [heyautoshops.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFQLL2gofsiTdhjhd9CMME1ESt1lZbq1xNY85OU034cpvPPN-sdjmcd9dYNXrkno60N0iFLfO3doTALS7In02uJX1IO_-CcJMsC8t7A6TpH2l2Dqk2Wd8NDxDOiE_TaesfXNoAHqr-ueiTeKA==)\n[5] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF4Xq6q80XSr9NxncY_0sIVIgMjGk3l8fSJ4mprZjbR9TAznY2k6c_KD7hLVaqleMN3yUBO291K5cfnARs168isyHNLTK-vF-mp2gKt7_ZYdUT3tMczPaDiR5-DAijf2OS7M36HTQeiyYXRcnm0EOKed-q4jRQfDOuxyLq0ryawuw7IZck=)\n[6] [autotrader.co.za](https://vert