    summary: "\"Cars on Caledon\" primarily refers to various car shows and automotive events held in Caledon, Ontario. These events often feature a wide array of vehicles, including classic, antique, and custom cars, which are typically displayed in diverse colors.\n\nKey events include:\n*   **Classic and Antique Car Show at the Caledon Fair:** This annual event, hosted by the Headwaters British Car Club, takes place at the Caledon Agricultural Society Fairgrounds. The 10th annual show is scheduled for Saturday, June 20, 2026, from 10 AM to 4 PM. Awards are given for categories such as \"Best Paint,\" suggesting a focus on the visual presentation and color of the cars[1][2][3][4].\n*   **Caledon Cruisers Car Shows:** The Caledon Cruisers also organize car shows, such as their 2023 Finale Car Show held in Downtown Bolton, which included awards for \"BEST CAR\" and \"BEST TRUCK\"[5][6].\n\nWhile specific photographic evidence of cars in the exact colors listed (orange, blue, green, yellow, black, gold, red, grey, white, navy, silver, charcoal, bronze) is not directly available through text search, car shows of this nature are well-known for featuring vehicles in a broad spectrum of colors, including those specified by the user.\n\nAdditionally, the Davis Family Farm Sunflower Festival in Caledon has featured photo opportunities with cars in its fields[7]. Caledon is also home to several car dealerships like Caledon Chrysler, Vaccaro Motors, and Caledon Motors, offering a selection of new and used vehicles that would naturally encompass a variety of colors[8][9][10][11][12].\n\nSources:\n[1] [caledonfair.ca](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH4CTiCnN2wSTr4Fx8cUuM0EMAl49rKPJ68N8bOt47Jstmghqa-4ECqsyjyeSo4mHr-f3RicFh1XyIL6DdCMkD3I8gkvSd-wt9ayg1YD7U2b8Bqu7Dc0M1BwcLX-qbpUH-GuuhR0fe5AspqFEVBHS8nWkQtDFjuqz-redHkflE=)\n[2] [motormeetups.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGhhrpa5Nrxz36ET5gobKtSRvJmnr5M7lqxcc7vP18g0Is5kaN33ni6SwXDObQaoTRpS_waCad7LabOo4Na82mod-R-0MEnGmhuJeiIiiOyZs_ut4v5bt3B16msN79yJwDBNX_caAmDe_JL46E1rJL_qLSg)\n[3] [headwatersbritishcarclub.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHpO2Xh_kB-VIZ0Z236fAOX8VJerAi_Zgh1Bx7iGaBZRGouuEfl4ixCnHUNNwvTYvzZZPFW4jI7-mJNp0lYvER02dD8NGSFee5EijssFz9sTeC46TfUuHHdhlz63doBN_R6_-O1-U09E_63TE9F-2CiRemas--Wcu89mw==)\n[4] [caledonfair.ca](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGEBEZhquivlWjObVXc4eLmZmyfEWvRoitp_I8o3XSaq5Ua7t_ER5GkpvKZXnbJpBBL-WRerbW6jON61CljGSvGY_aA9hNhlSCxnkW8bsGQ38SR7MMn81sbIK9bo6msXOEZ)\n[5] [downtownbolton.ca](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEvzMQWhgTX0XtxRfDo1yPidw634uqoHrpm4SdOm8svTqKQ4q-t9jwY9KQWiNOIkenKUL2Xu2s0vU07qXl1mWYad9L0m4hAqCKL2HkcGRuyvELeiInrGcuvqGXM9tZ_EzvCHjeDeLocipCX7YJ4IDCfuFePCoze0Na8o2ab45n-E8D9)\n[6] [bramclassauto.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQECkvJbZv5zWZS3u3fRErb_Ayzr1ARYZ8UTOEy_D2KKx-9l1_7U_wdAm2Yhq69cuOopV0c0XpDCvx-dOB79I4K8HE-d2kRloLur-WPjYw7em2kW_nYdRPjl88I71nN_Lr3zhFTn9iDeOOFTStAd2f9qGGfBEAJAd7iXQAe-O3z2Xbz_K4rLouWwkPhZBUcbiwoiCD_kTdM=)\n[7] [visitcaledon.ca](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEvVSbYnPuJFthPFH34G1jXpIJ9TSAwt0TVuQKjoheo6NsC0GGfZaDc6CbmXACMFBxt81yrZVforoCJXl-MhfYvGsJl3q4zNCucfilCMGTHo02mFm5ICCNprzCqGWU=)\n[8] [caledonchrysler.ca](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGMIIMyw1ItNwd03MS29os2IcHAoM5wbvR9eYKnBxPfdn2njFnxSHdAmagg4oqFUhcDlmMNGQIpUIrNcbwBm-9EVXCAUAxmG54ye9roTMkQW778GOVXvA==)\n[9] [cargurus.ca](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHAb2w9Hq0phpxQrtzpwgXw4p3iklJfSnFwIlY8TY7Q3Fahm1gFpT4n3Fg5ni5RiZi_flJEsOfruEm1UX1-BV8FOpTfBCLAukYotlKFa_4MUVQDYXArx_y0oRUd75fTuBOy3QZYhtr6oP2qJN1l-4OkBiuWg7I=)\n[10] [vaccaromotors.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF_R6BCeqORvFTmGe_jCG9hrTRsqg0Xivf