    }
    summary: "Several automotive businesses are associated with the name \"Caledon\" in various locations, each with its own branding and identity.\n\n**Cars On Caledon (Uitenhage, South Africa)**\nThis dealership specializes in affordable, reliable pre-owned vehicles. Their \"About\" section emphasizes a straightforward approach: \"quality cars, fair deals, no nonsense\"[1]. Specific details about their logo, brand colors, or the exterior/interior of their dealership are not explicitly provided in the search results.\n\n**Caledon Chrysler (Ontario, Canada)**\nPart of the CarHub group, Caledon Chrysler is an authorized Stellantis dealer offering new and used Ram, Dodge, Chrysler, and Jeep vehicles[2]. Their branding includes a \"Chrysler white logo\"[2]. The dealership promotes a \"Drive Happy Promise,\" focusing on a transparent and personalized car-buying experience, including \"hassle-free\" pricing and \"no hidden fees\"[2]. They serve communities like Caledon, Brampton, Bolton, and Orangeville[2].\n\n**Caledon Motors (South Africa and Ireland)**\nThere appear to be two distinct entities named Caledon Motors.\n*   **Caledon Motors (Durban North, KwaZulu Natal, South Africa):** This dealership sells quality used cars[3]. Information regarding its specific logo or branding colors is not detailed, but their website highlights an \"Award-winning, family owned dealership of new and pre-owned vehicles\"[3][4].\n*   **Caledon Motors (Cavan, Ireland):** This dealership also sells used cars and features a logo on its website[5].\n\n**Other Caledon-based Car Businesses:**\n*   **Caledon Mitsubishi (Orangeville/Caledon, Canada):** This dealership offers used vehicles for sale[6][7].\n*   **CanxCars (Caledon, ON, Canada):** This business focuses on providing \"top-quality used automobiles\" with an emphasis on \"honesty and transparency\"[8].\n*   **Caledon Toyota (South Africa):** This dealership sells pre-owned vehicles[9].\n\nSources:\n[1] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGjtFK-yD7Pkuknl06UxB_8WWHprv32yQW_48AURZWRAGeRHFIUnEqnLYLVUypKTBRQD42elf29n_QyIVHAcKVEklDSLglgLqN6_D6j1QOA4JF9Kv3i0OMCxUt4uyQxq9Z50n11Nz52scx0BL3UjUd6avvmUQ==)\n[2] [caledonchrysler.ca](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGUN1jcX0Uf2vktzO6UQdWieEMTSa9gliT4pNkHIOvagyY6SyQKkNnuSrolsfTAsu-pnCjniUGC_3KFqWx5IX-He5GQC3p9AixiHszkfn8Oy6LrQ0EA3g==)\n[3] [caledonmotors.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG6jb0n8RXw05gSuoglGftF3TGv7szNBJZpnH49AlbaaTwdzbUhcYzZ5U-vkEzoXtG1GCMQ3gvY0wM28UrX-y5JM17Y-sFTnqabmGKyF8zZUPIr3ilcWXo=)\n[4] [caledonmotors.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGd-7qZSvHvJT1BBkMF4uGv1imRFqeemmFvTMc6T2uY_8S5pwSuv6SrTxO6-OWjA7f37RLapiNSMjovjnENbmHYlwepknGiD0M76u_rLNuNbSEVDA-w4oa8a2-q4jd5dcnNFfx0ew==)\n[5] [caledonmotors.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFdMFJyNbM3bQRh7m9js3z85DUHICG54-IPnkk1HpVqYiW53njGxHf8yJr1IbGerUI7TYgBSWUoBFNwMq03yCNz0Debd8nzU4Gb3U6ttqpYTm3IIrgTYFRJYHkxsyA-FQ==)\n[6] [caledonmitsubishi.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQENwBNZorcCs-rvqXvczN1FTHb4enaL0vPfaGF5MESPe2WPgxJgRopT-UmWApbXQNi1JYLqqbAdg-SYh53x68dyMoaGmQFgofYa20znhkqUPPFQLqYx3BpXsBh8HKgq3F064IoczQ1zNbfw2zv-nXf0LUyTWkxxjHKIWg==)\n[7] [caledonmitsubishi.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHFouJslwVH_q4kBmXjh38FYv6MjnIKjhTk_A4WJQDrR9EeiOVLCCQjLkE9oMHT9kyD6emuAHBQEw2rWZJIeDfj7sSA7qHKXA4U0ZbGBqsSS6D92OlHbERvlwkjzaonZKY7SAfdehi8PfvcmhjB)\n[8] [canxcars.ca](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEX_cDnM7nH-GhJtypFI4a-8Fp043eDEIa7k4-mw6_1OTf5Ks9cQdj4x2PAUajB7IyNV-xXmmMEYRQ2WISIVOGZ1Ritjgwqg1-Y6HqKXWSH)\n[9] [toyota.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEzgo-wmpskWI1ld4bC8cutS_9P6ISeZXSwloJpLH3FaGrLXZQX_Qc4abXAa4aKwgVJBRO9p_5G3LgAEB88csfOWHB4gIR