    summary: "\"Cars on Caledon\" likely refers to car-related events held in Caledon, Ontario, Canada. These events include:\n\n*   The \"Classic and Antique Car Show - Caledon Fair,\" which is the \"10th Annual HBCC All British Classic & Antique Car Show.\" This event is scheduled for Saturday, June 20, 2026, from 10 am to 4 pm at the Caledon Agricultural Society Fairgrounds. It features classic and antique cars, with awards for categories like \"Best Of Show\" and \"People\'s Choice.\"[1][2]\n*   The \"Caledon Cruisers car show,\" which occurs weekly on Thursdays from 6 pm to 9 pm at the Canadian Tire parking lot in Bolton, located at 99 McEwan Drive East.[3]\n*   \"Electrify Caledon,\" an electric vehicle (EV) event, was held on August 10 at the Caledon Centre for Recreation and Wellness in Bolton. This event allows residents to test drive EV models and attend information sessions.[4]\n\nThere is no direct information linking \"257 Caledon Street\" to any of the \"Cars on Caledon\" events or related automotive businesses in the search results. While there are mentions of other addresses like \"257 Dundas Street East\" for a ServiceOntario location[5] and phone numbers containing \"257\"[6][7], none of these connect to \"257 Caledon Street\" in relation to car events. The car shows are typically held at the Caledon Agricultural Society Fairgrounds or specific parking lots in Bolton.[1][2][3][4]\n\nSources:\n[1] [caledonfair.ca](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFLLGOsry77AyHeVN1RX7ECdSMGjJmx0fNBcvVtYoPesMOuZLQyKWVhfosK-qG7zrF1Mml5QZ1W11O4yhxKsh5ckkCIAYjIO49_ORwMBtAuV_hl34ul22-rTAL1HFpoUAcIXNGSnPhSNajkKBVBvgvcEImOhj7c-3XvwpsLY5M=)\n[2] [caledonfair.ca](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFNUu_udxaCQKC-TS5RGhdZXlPLTNtJyd47V-UZCZh4YlqjieqG1aRUXY5c7ZOfjF5-jwLvzwadN2y_ZU4tH9-qsoPliOLKl9wZii27Vr7HAFwehyHbVg==)\n[3] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHaVd3