    summary: "\"Cars on Caledon\" appears to be a car dealership located at 98 Caledon St, Cannon Hill, Kariega, 6229, South Africa[1][2][3]. They specialize in affordable, reliable pre-owned vehicles[4].\n\nBased on recent listings, Cars on Caledon has offered vehicles in the following colors:\n*   **Blue:**\n    *   2023 Volkswagen Tiguan 1.4TSI 110kW Life in Night Shade Blue Metallic[5].\n    *   2023 Volkswagen Polo Hatch 1.0TSI 70kW in blue[6].\n    *   2016 Volkswagen Polo Hatch 1.2TSI Highline Auto in blue[7].\n    *   2021 Volkswagen Tiguan 1.4TSI Comfortline R-Line in Lapiz Blue[8].\n\nWhile specific cars in \"gold,\" \"navy,\" or \"yellow\" at \"Cars on Caledon\" were not prominently featured in the search results, the dealership is listed in a document related to \"Employer Contributions to Provident Funds\" that mentions \"YELLOW STONE AUTO\" and \"NAVY SERVICE STATION CC\" in a broader context of the motor industry provident fund, and \"COMSIC GOLD TRADING\" related to a transport sector retirement fund[9]. This does not directly indicate that \"Cars on Caledon\" sells vehicles of those colors, but rather shows those colors appear in business names within the wider automotive and related industries.\n\nSources:\n[1] [cybo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG3PW6po0F9y5_siWrvmM0EIajyOTlM_mXcLptFh7I61c8DDpVNDHO0LZIrAm7qziYSlooAtzf7jnwXEai97Rtti_Rf8-KotOf0nd6tNxHjDxaqcYf5fcm34bH4S4d-2AcbJT2eWEGdjVtrcOAC4c9lsgbuaxC9iDDLOfzZTmCHdnTXCxIU0E6XU0EZ7cbB6Q==)\n[2] [cybo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH9RugmZHZprY47Cij6XxGpizJqW4JRIFWGW_Uhmyj8uWOGV-tUMbpjPDFtN-8afgoHSD8TAP7j-Tv6S40JbhmVzDggCSa5VL--8wOcAEcBwEHJbFDTvN1Iy0V29e05KHEjYjFIHfeKJQ==)\n[3] [cybo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFyVNqW7Z1PTIpQqnTaJsavL_b45ZAa0CvP2cyAYVRupjZZspYqj2g531b_1IExxuxrefhq4-Or2c1AgFSbLPWV85drUOIS0xCDkteqUrzk9nY-INrnLu9wBI_LqCJ2J3ExYGPZv1LRqPgoIZU=)\n[4] [autotra