    summary: "Several car dealerships in Kariega (formerly Uitenhage) are located on or near Caledon Street and feature blue in their branding or have blue vehicles available.\n\n**Cars On Caledon**, a dealership specializing in affordable, reliable pre-owned vehicles, is located in Uitenhage Central, which is now part of Kariega.[1][2][3] While a specific logo color for \"Cars On Caledon\" is not explicitly stated in the search results, it is a prominent car-related business on Caledon Street in the specified location.\n\n**Hyundai Kariega**, situated at 249 Caledon Street, Kariega, is another relevant dealership.[4][5] Hyundai\'s corporate logo is typically blue.[5] Hyundai Kariega has listings for used vehicles, including a 2025 Hyundai Exter 1.2 Executive 2 Tone MT in \"Cosmic Blue+Black Roof.\"[5]\n\n**Nissan Uitenhage** (Group1 Nissan) is also located near Caledon Street, at 36 Church Street, Uitenhage.[6] Nissan\'s brand logo is generally blue.[6]\n\nAdditionally, **CFAO Mobility Toyota Uitenhage** is located at 140 Caledon Street, Uitenhage.[7][8] Although Toyota\'s logo is red, this dealership is on Caledon Street in the relevant area.\n\nSources:\n[1] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGQkdJr8PKQ97j0aHgEncjZSAfJec-FZ6WsNS146wkvmE43QzkWTa-s6npQ5tTnbyoiK05Ctz3TMLSN40gBjngnfz4hdJuW4rOEieWLqGj2NLF6KR0gBlVl75x3z5Qy0IK_hBTdU0Ee4RpTu6vzWQMs8YBdaw==)\n[2] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHWMNTH5fYvavhoXmjvxvTxP6M0ievioT2evpCFLmYHih6JUMxazOwa3pd6JJNZFkmtqbX1P-SYr_FTBhwfUA5l_mGHFczR_eXdFtfxT6_2gET6EabrTFW2iuJ8JK31M2iuP6eiXebIpfqDc5_JvFH3ax8_oGVTJ1lXvDj_59hMyw==)\n[3] [destinali.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEO8XuKS7-mEUcpUHFGve7DPX_lhwO0W9m28TWVh2KYzbVM287ckGhevqzpBc1PBjaCZ8su1mwbSDILY6ocMSd6pWFHs1tKoxAKxyt0l-ErAkjyXz-cOWzzPat95q1Yy-sA9dcUVdyWVySf2243hdMz2zIcufvLpScZMaoyDvt8)\n[4] [kelston.co.za](https://vertexaisear