    summary: "A Facebook page for \"Cars on Caledon\" was not directly found in the search results. However, information about a car dealership named \"Cars On Caledon\" in Uitenhage, South Africa, is available on AutoTrader. This dealership has a logo displayed on its AutoTrader listings[1][2][3].\n\nAccording to the \"About\" section on AutoTrader, \"Cars on Caledon\" specializes in affordable, reliable pre-owned vehicles, focusing on quality cars, fair deals, and transparent transactions[4]. They aim to provide honest deals and real value for customers buying their first car or upgrading[4].\n\nSources:\n[1] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH4HX52MAxF1E9JS0z68JdDKkYF_Z9oESzXXFxh-NQULecPeW0jlvtb6Eii3oMWBbt2REza5LQwtAWl23lMzREEMZCtGv9p7e3mCz7o7K9iqqHczIW0PEKCo8371oQ6IddXod7XcaT2sK5xmM7ixJQ9t19Q3-F_cAE3y0kXdjTPq5V71ThqGYv9j46weBKwHHmGeqB12zEeyVN9giDuFk8uGrvdog==)\n[2] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFpBzIyVPPRz724-tH4H397ISY0fotjL1NgIxRVChv7TE9Kbgyz4b5TNL6OI3eGiMjsD9ymipgiGI1DGo55C6oxeURLkyaDd6N8xtqFDH140cGA2ShPdxcuGLpGUjc9_5C4_2lKDNk9QZh1eGwwXecDnhzhy0JcRywMMgfpUVZMZzG8R1-83c2WzzgOcAP1H5Tz)\n[3] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG4Wi-dl0ieyBrtuYEwJWDshaUM-03WqyH4xuKvSDnkUPbGica8ccJtpnJxrmjqpReRwJWe3QnSu-80WOZbv-5euL74227LHHgp5mUGWdWz0rqsVWMlWoi53_HtLA2olHAsRKV6laUG6NmN53eTkwnRcgqIvQ32IH2n9P8-tiRDGKFuuVWw3BcVA9qaWfE=)\n[4] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGClD5I8qbwTh543O0Qtxcp4zWGFpX68MVAx57jhjVe-8TW5IziZQXPtnZOw2hVMCe5TpRSUZrFs0pC1WDsOtMgGPWAs-5ibb2YTnuc0kJaQqRxAGM6UF9anh6F42v_CI6CvpHSd9hbm0Vvqm7BKhR2QqA4)"
