    summary: "\"Cars on Caledon\" refers to a used car dealership located in Uitenhage Central, which is now known as Kariega. The dealership is listed on platforms like AutoTrader and Destinali[1][2]. It holds a customer rating of 3.3 stars based on 5 reviews[1].\n\nIn addition to \"Cars on Caledon,\" several other automotive businesses are situated on Caledon Street in the Kariega/Uitenhage area:\n*   **Hyundai Kariega** can be found at 249 Caledon Street, Kariega[3][4].\n*   **CFAO Mobility Toyota Uitenhage** is located at 140 Caledon Street, Uitenhage[5][6][7].\n*   **Kelston Tyremart Uitenhage**, also known as TYREMART UITENHAGE KELSTON MOTORS (PTY) LTD T/A, operates from 249 Caledon Street, Uitenhage, sharing an address with Hyundai Kariega[8][9].\n*   **Koedoes Auto**, another used car dealer, is located at 41 Caledon, 17 Tern Street, Rosedale, Kariega[10].\n\nSources:\n[1] [autotrader.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGiKwZRutbdjhy_m0xkgpE30CPUMFfHICg2rqO6q3CmBvsl7CikAltRet_OzzGtYFmUgJ6x1aNIAg5fLPeZmnWVfmXq4ttF82QC94jKVvUQrMSTedLB2Hj4_K43bBVV80P-_aoCLblsWYOnDUcSFi7ZA0wzRw==)\n[2] [destinali.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEBnAw5OA0IDHExA-HNeMUUaRPkLFTopO96OMotlP9CaOtUlVum8j-dMO6iIP45r_KGfc9QG6_I92j4dru3xIwZmF1QEkzurndHGUFR-CxmHPZlABFbOvkUOPmSo5JyCRBhEGl1zP8Wa_hECpEnHJ5TnxmxvsjQ4SGrC0rHfuGo)\n[3] [kelston.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEUkNAPKCQgW5Ffo2gXENLTa1Jngte7o5Aex7ktLCX0e-_JJFXOyZji3NdwuhcZzwGtJSp1xobO4BQl0pDLbHSTFacKFgS8VDYr9SQh7B_0yUKA5lfDSfCTnASBHkYqQk7lEy-jyEJCPAQ85rGWWg==)\n[4] [kelston.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE-2QUgLMn0Lcb2CE1dhjGiMDL6WAkHGPlkbyaqum9G5VMk9Wu82Qq_qfMu132yuAU6rofQHJGewGvgkQKLVABXHy_OdGppcMSAxeQ5eKytDb-s8Ogjbrtr)\n[5] [cars.co.za](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHQEtca30I1UgK2LuPw-BI8FIYF4z_gEjRlzHCz3iYTI3lSDNksBsX-A3Q