    summary: "Unsplash offers a wide selection of photos for the requested car models. While specific photo IDs are not directly available in the search results, you can find numerous images for each model by visiting the Unsplash website and searching for the respective terms.\n\nHere\'s a summary of the availability of images on Unsplash for each model:\n*   **Ford Ranger**: Over 100 free images are available.[1]\n*   **Golf GTI**: More than 100 free images can be downloaded.[2] Examples include a modern black Volkswagen Golf GTI parked outdoors[3], a red Volkswagen Golf GTI 5-door hatchback[4], a red Volkswagen Golf GTI driving on a highway[5], and a teal Volkswagen Golf GTI with a custom body kit[6].\n*   **BMW M2**: Over 100 free images are available.[7] Examples include a blue custom BMW M2 coupe[8], a light blue BMW M2 parked at night[9], a blue BMW M2 parked in a garage[10], and a dark grey BMW M2 driving on a city street[11].\n*   **Audi RS3**: Over 100 free images are available.[12] You can find photos such as a white RS3 car[13], a white Audi RS3 at night[14], and a white Audi RS3 glowing in the night[15].\n*   **Toyota Hilux**: Over 58 free images are available.[16]\n*   **Mercedes AMG**: Over 100 free images are available, including those for Mercedes-Benz AMG[17][18], Mercedes AMG GT[19], Mercedes AMG One[20], and Mercedes AMG GTR[21].\n*   **Polo GTI**: Over 30 free images are available.[22]\n*   **Fortuner**: Over 28 free images are available, including those specifically for Toyota Fortuner[23][24] and Fortuner Legender[25].\n\nTo find specific photo IDs, it is recommended to visit the Unsplash website (unsplash.com) and use the search bar for each car model.\n\nSources:\n[1] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHzXHY6HDPxiHrWItQpeS8oEii-vgaxB3kNHq-aRWnbjkNSiTyL9aL6jFjkq87R3cGlLIW0i7dl8sUEI-T4xltcTFYJPFLfI1Ay3wIEG97NIgNu35P02Rf8UWcz3CL5JfvDYwv5)\n[2] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.co