    summary: "The search on Unsplash for \"orange\" colored trucks, specifically \"Tacoma\", \"Ranger\", \"Colorado\", \"Raptor\", or \"pickup\" and \"truck\", did not return direct image results from Unsplash within the provided snippets. However, the search results include various listings and discussions about orange pickup trucks, particularly Toyota Tacomas and Ford Raptors and Rangers.\n\nHere\'s a summary of related findings:\n*   **Toyota Tacoma**: There are listings for used orange Toyota Tacomas for sale from various model years, including 2025, 2023, 2018, 2017, and 2016. These listings often detail features, mileage, and locations[1][2]. Some Tacomas are described with \"Inferno\" exterior color and \"Black/Orange\" interior[2].\n*   **Ford F-150 Raptor**: Several used orange Ford F-150 Raptors are available for sale[3]. New Ford F-150 Raptors are also offered for sale in Orange, though their exterior colors are listed as \"Carbonized Gray Metallic\" and \"Agate Black Metallic\"[4].\n*   **Ford Ranger Raptor**: A YouTube video highlights a \"Ford Ranger Raptor in Code Orange with Raptor Pack\"[5].\n*   **General Pickup Truck Information**: The search results also indicate that these vehicles are generally 4-door Crew Cabs, classified as pickup trucks, with various engine types and drivetrains[1].\n\nWhile direct image links from Unsplash are not present in these search results, the information confirms the existence and availability of orange-colored models for the specified truck types.\n\nSources:\n[1] [carmax.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHedNfY0X_hkixcdkDKwzzCMIZPPLlR19glLf_1r_tVUaT1pCue6RMT6d_RDy9FBG6ANvvbvhVs2jtNOuiwxOSQbsrqYS07SlC-khV9IbsdhAfKf4wk568ofGAX-FYYlor_qivy4XPFQoeFjA==)\n[2] [cars.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHpVPHNlhS5xuTsvXoSJLTGqewGy5JQYU89k7u1xbMxFd3ID_0z_A_KOIhDVTu7F7EsLMw1JMHFAXmBO8Ow_qzy_XbQp8R-e7CnyhucgcmOvVU2ZRbcmQBxlHTat2k4xoaP-OYzudSRowcej