  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Exploring Car Images**\n\nI\'m currently exploring Unsplash IDs for car images, specifically focusing on a Ford Ranger in Sabre Orange. I\'ve located a couple of potential image URLs: `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1533514114760-4389f572ae26` and `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1549399542-7e3f`. I will examine these further.\n\n\n**Refining Image Selection**\n\nI\'ve decided to use `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1549399542-7e3f8b79c341?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80` for the Ranger Wildtrak, it\'s a perfect match. I also found `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568605117036-5fe5e7bab0b7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80`, a beautiful orange off-road truck. I\'m also looking into `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1609521263047-f8f205293f24` for a Hilux Legend. Finally, I will check if there is a Fortuner SUV image.\n\n\n**Assigning Vehicle Images**\n\nI\'ve decided on images for the vehicles. The Ford Ranger Wildtrak will use a rugged image for the front, and gallery images of a mud shot and a trail climb. I found a nice image for the VW Polo GTI. This should do the trick!\n\n\n**Finalizing Hatchback Images**\n\nI\'ve selected the image `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541899481282-d53bffe3c35d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80` for the Reef Blue Polo GTI cover, and a garage/studio setting photo for the gallery. I\'ve also identified a good image for a Pure White Golf GTI. Additionally, I found compelling gallery options, including a sunlit blue car and a dynamic shot of a hatchback on a winding road.\n\n\n**Confirming Vehicle Imagery**\n\nI\'ve now finalized the images for both the Toyota Fortuner and the Mercedes-AMG A45. I have selected specific cover and gallery images for the Fortuner, including a mountain track and desert dune shots. The A45 will feature a stunning grey hatchback in a garage setting as the cover, with an additional premium image for the gallery.\n\n\n**Selecting Final Images**\n\nI\'ve located a great luxury car back end image: `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550285741-352877338535-766e1452684a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80`. I\'ve confirmed that the Ascot Grey VW Polo 1.0 TSI Life cover image is perfect: `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1617531653332-bd46c24f2068?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80`. Also, I\'ve chosen matching gallery shots: `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541899481282-d53bffe3c35d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80` and `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542282088-fe8426682b8f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80`. Lastly, I have selected the cover image for the Long Beach Blue BMW M2 Coup\303\251: `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1617814076367-b759c7d7e738?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80` and the gallery image: `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555215695-3004980ad54e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80`.\n\n\n**Finalizing RS3 and Hilux**\n\nI\'ve selected the perfect Nardo Grey Audi RS3 Sportback image as a cover, it\'s a spot-on match! I\'ve also identified appropriate gallery options, including a classic silver Audi hatchback and a similar grey hatchback to the Mercedes-AMG. For the Hilux Legend, the cover image is perfect, with gallery images of a dark grey pickup truck offroad.\n\n\n"
